  m_text: "The game duration is 2 minutes, score more to win\r\nBoth teams have to play on 2-5-3 formation\r\n\r\n\r\nControl: \n\r\nTeam Blue (Gamepad only): \n1. Left stick up down for moving the rods\r\n2. Right stick left right for rotating the players\r\n\r\nTeam Red (Keyboard only): \n1. W S or Arrow up Arrow down for moving the rods\r\n2. A D or Arrow left Arrow right for rotating the players"
